{"id":79,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"誠実勤勉と自立心を育む女子教育","feature_description":"共立女子中学校・高等学校は、女子教育の伝統を持ち、学力と豊かな人間性を育てる学校です。中高一貫の学び、学校行事、探究、部活動を通して、自立心、協働性、表現力を伸ばします。生徒一人ひとりが自分の目標を見つけ、社会で主体的に活躍するための基礎を築くことを大切にしています。公式サイトの紹介内容をもとに、教育方針や学校生活を整理してまとめています。","clubs":[{"id":818,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kyoritsu-wu.ac.jp/chukou/about/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":819,"name":"テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kyoritsu-wu.ac.jp/chukou/about/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":820,"name":"太極拳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kyoritsu-wu.ac.jp/chukou/about/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":821,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kyoritsu-wu.ac.jp/chukou/about/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":822,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kyoritsu-wu.ac.jp/chukou/about/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":823,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kyoritsu-wu.ac.jp/chukou/about/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":824,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kyoritsu-wu.ac.jp/chukou/about/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":825,"name":"バトン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kyoritsu-wu.ac.jp/chukou/about/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":826,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kyoritsu-wu.ac.jp/chukou/about/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":827,"name":"陸上部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kyoritsu-wu.ac.jp/chukou/about/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":828,"name":"英語部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kyoritsu-wu.ac.jp/chukou/about/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":829,"name":"茶道部（遠州流・不白流）","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kyoritsu-wu.ac.jp/chukou/about/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":830,"name":"能楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kyoritsu-wu.